  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Primary path: submit a weekly report",
      "items": [
        "ReportSlot calls POST /api/v1/report-slots/{id}/submit with the Bearer token",
        "auth(\"st\") checks token, session row, consent and verification; placement_access confirms it is the student's own placement",
        "service.submit checks the four text fields, moves draft → submitted, and writes the audit row and a report.submitted outbox row",
        "A pending similarity check is added in the same commit and runs after the response is sent",
        "The deliver job emails and pushes report.submitted to the academic supervisor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust boundaries",
      "items": [
        "The browser holds only the access token (sessionStorage); the service worker never caches /api/ answers",
        "Role and gate failures return 401/403 before the request body is validated",
        "Files reach a browser only through GET /files/{id} after the owning record's permission check; the bucket stays private",
        "Only the API process holds the database URL and the storage service key"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Background work in the API process",
      "items": [
        "APScheduler starts with the API when SCHEDULER_ENABLED=true",
        "deliver_notifications every minute, similarity_retry every 5 minutes; reminders, escalations and Missing flags every 15",
        "Each run holds a PostgreSQL advisory lock and records a job_runs row",
        "Email is retried up to 5 times; push is skipped without VAPID keys or a subscription"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "AI stays inside the API",
      "items": [
        "intfloat/multilingual-e5-small (384-d) is baked into the image, so no text leaves the process",
        "Without the model, matching uses basic rules and similarity checks are marked failed for the retry job",
        "A similarity flag is advisory: it never changes a report status or a grade"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Where it runs",
      "items": [
        "Local: docker compose with pgvector/pg16, Mailpit, the API on :8000 and the web app on :5173",
        "Reference deployment: Vercel (web), Hugging Face Space (API), Supabase (database and bucket), Gmail SMTP",
        "GitHub Actions deploys the API, pings /health every 6 hours, and takes nightly encrypted backups"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Left out of the drawing",
      "items": [
        "About 20 other routers (vacancies, matching, grades, certificates, exports…) share the same gate and database",
        "The gate's own read of user_sessions in PostgreSQL",
        "Offline drafts kept in localStorage until saved; submitting always needs the connection"
      ]
    }
  ]
}